{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39840","headline":"春草碧色 · 殷文圭","name":"春草碧色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"细草含愁碧，芊绵南浦滨。\n萋萋如恨别，苒苒共伤春。\n疎雨烟华润，斜阳细彩匀。\n花黏繁鬬锦，人藉软胜茵。\n浅映宫池水，轻遮辇路尘。\n杜回如可结，誓作报恩身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷文圭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39840.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39840","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}